[[File:Steel_Plating.png|thumb|right|150px|Steel plating.]]
'''Steel''' was a type of alloy used throughout [[the galaxy]]. Crude but efficient, steel was used to protect the inner components of [[Army|military]] towers. One type of steel, [[durasteel]], was also used for this purpose, as well as many others, such as combat [[armor]].<ref name="GD">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Defense]]''</ref> During the [[High Republic Era]],<ref name="Lost/Found">{{Acolyte|Lost / Found}}</ref> the [[Sith Lord]]<ref name="229 Companion">{{InsiderCite|229|Star Wars: The Acolyte Companion|''Star Wars: The Acolyte'' Companion}}</ref> known as "[[the Stranger]]" made it a point to tell his [[Sith acolyte]] [[Mae-ho Aniseya|Mae-ho "Mae" Aniseya]] that weapons made of steel were not a threat to the [[Jedi]], nor were those that used [[laser]] technology.<ref name="Lost/Found" /> While it was possible to kill a Jedi with a metal<ref name="Monster">{{TCW|Monster}}</ref> or laser-based weapon,<ref name="ROTS">{{Film|III}}</ref> the Stranger's point was to order Aniseya to slay a Jedi without any weapon whatsoever, falling into his overall plan to kill "the dream" of the [[Jedi Order]].<ref name="Lost/Found" />

